              "bbox": [
                0.058,
                0.234,
                0.948,
                0.253
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1、Tm(熔解温度)；2、中心法则；3、信号肽；4、Isozyme；5、辅基；6、β-oxidation;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.058,
                0.256,
                0.951,
                0.274
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7、Competitive inhibition; 8、Okazaki fragment; 9、一碳单位; 10、Active site"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.058,
            0.277,
            0.354,
            0.295
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "二、问答题（15 题，120 分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.058,
            0.298,
            0.717,
            0.316
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1、将下列化学名称与 B 族维生素及其辅酶形式相匹配？（7 分）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.065,
            0.319,
            0.95,
            0.401
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.068,
                0.319,
                0.948,
                0.339
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "（A）泛酸；（B）烟酸；（C）叶酸；（D）硫胺素；（E）核黄素；（F）吡哆素；（G）生物素。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.068,
                0.341,
                0.945,
                0.359
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "(1) B1 ; (2) B2 ; (3) B3 ; (4) B5 ; (5) B6 ; (6) B7 ; (7) B11; (8) B12。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.061,
                0.362,
                0.946,
                0.401
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "(I) FMN; (II) FAD; (III) NAD+; (IV) NADP+; (V) CoA; (VI) PLP; (VII) PMP; (VIII) FH2, FH4; (IX) TPP。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.404,
            0.95,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2、通过计算 1mol 乙酰辅酶 A 完全氧化成  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "CO_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  和  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "H_{2}O"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  生成的 ATP 摩尔数，简述该代谢途径的亚细胞部位、关键酶和限速酶、以及重要的生理意义。(12 分)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.447,
            0.95,
            0.466
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3、一个单链 DNA 和一个单链 RNA 分子量相同，试述至少 4 种方法将它们区分开？（8 分）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.058,
            0.469,
            0.545,
            0.488
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4、说明影响酶促反应速度的主要因素？（6分）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.058,
            0.49,
            0.781,
            0.508
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5、以下列 DNA 片断为模板， F1: 3' —ATACAGTCGAGCACTGATCAC—5'"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.371,
            0.511,
            0.781,
            0.53
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "F2: 5' —TATGTCAGCTCGTGACTAGTG—3'"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.058,
            0.532,
            0.387,
            0.551
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "箭头方向（每个2分，共10分）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.554,
            0.952,
            0.68
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 21,
              "bbox": [
                0.098,
                0.554,
                0.576,
                0.573
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "a）若箭头表示复制方向，则哪条链为前导链？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 22,
              "bbox": [
                0.098,
                0.575,
                0.685,
                0.595
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "b) 若复制该 DNA，反应体系中至少需要哪些反应物参加？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 23,
              "bbox": [
                0.098,
                0.597,
                0.576,
                0.616
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "c) 若箭头表示转录方向，则哪条链为模板链？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 24,
              "bbox": [
                0.098,
                0.618,
                0.755,
                0.637
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "d) 如以该模板合成 RNA，反应体系中至少需要哪些反应物参加？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 25,
              "bbox": [
                0.098,
                0.639,
                0.951,
                0.679
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "e）写出由它复制、转录及翻译的产物，并注明各产物的两端（5’、3’、N 端、C 端）"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.682,
            0.95,
            0.722
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "密码表: UAU 酪 CAG 谷氨酰胺 AUG 蛋 GUC 缬 UGU 半胱 CUC 亮 AGC 丝 GCU 丙 UCA 丝 CGU 精 ACU 苏 GUG 缬 UCG 丝 CUA 亮 AGU 丝 GAC 天冬"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.725,
            0.949,
            0.765
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6、磺胺类药物抑菌作用属于酶的何种抑制作用, 此种抑制有何特点? 并阐述其抑菌机理。(10 分)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 28,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.767,
            0.51,
            0.786
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7、写出谷草转氨酶催化的化学反应。(4 分)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 29,
          "bbox": [
            0.056,
            0.789,
            0.949,
            0.829
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8、Anfinsen 用核糖核酸酶进行变性—复性实验，在蛋白质结构方面得出重要结论是什么？（12 分）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
